{"id":802478,"title":"03｜为什么我们需要KG- RAG？","content":"KG-RAG旨在解决传统RAG存在的问题，通过引入知识图谱增强相关性和召回效果。传统RAG的chunk方式常召回噪声片段，而KG可通过实体特征提高相关性。此外，传统RAG中chunk间缺乏关联，导致跨文档查询时信息分散，KG则能通过图谱关联增强chunk间的联系，提高召回率。假设已有KG存在，可作为补充信息源，进一步丰富上下文。KG不仅能提供实体embedding，还能生成包含拓扑结构的graph embedding，从而提升文档和chunk的embedding质量，实现更精准的召回。KG-RAG的主要优势在于降噪、提召、提准及补充上下文，但构建高质量、灵活更新且计算简单的大型图谱成本高昂。因此，在实际应用中需权衡其ROI。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":393618,"user_name":"苏果果","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":2852467,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"12A62ED032F345","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/2b/86/73/5190bbde.jpg","comment_is_top":true,"comment_ctime":1724323330,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":1,"score":2,"product_id":100799801,"comment_content":"各位同学，课程不提供PPT资料，特此声明～","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1610667,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/18/93/ab/fb24e493.jpg","nickname":"PowerLover","note":"","ucode":"BF4A81C534BE35","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":650775,"discussion_content":"那么相关的代码有吗？","content_length":10,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1725604259,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"四川","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]}]}